# ===== COMING SOON MODE =====
# Re-enabled 2026-09-20 while Genki 2.0 is built. The gate itself is NOT here —
# it lives in functions/_middleware.js, because a Pages Function runs before
# static assets and can keep /box and /api untouched. Turn it off with the
# COMING_SOON=0 environment variable on the Pages project, not by editing this file.
# Cloudflare Pages handles clean-URL .html routing automatically — no rewrites needed here.

# Genki QR box landing — per-code partner-branded pages live at
# box/GK-[CODE]/index.html and are served directly by Cloudflare Pages'
# directory-index resolution. The bare /box route still serves
# box-landing.html via a 301 below; the per-code rule was removed because
# it was hijacking the partner pages.
/box   /box-landing   301

# Products page retired 2026-05-21 — may return rebranded later.
# 302 (not 301) so the redirect is not permanently cached.
/products   /   302
